    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/d9c9f9bfd81f63ac543f56d8c92f4925.poster.avif?t=1721557813\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/d9c9f9bfd81f63ac543f56d8c92f4925.webm?t=1721557813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/d9c9f9bfd81f63ac543f56d8c92f4925.mp4?t=1721557813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Description</h2>A fog of mystery envelops everything you look at. And it's as if you yourself are dissolved in it. Who are you? Where? And why? These questions have yet to be answered.<br>For here <strong>IT</strong> is... glittered and then faded. Gone away. But it flooded your body with steel determination.<br>All the hostility of the dark world begs another question - didn't it ever want you to wake up? All the answers, ahead of you. Where there's only a glimpse of light. That's where <strong>IT</strong> lead you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/bb57fc1528f4c25980e7712aac33840a.poster.avif?t=1721557813\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/bb57fc1528f4c25980e7712aac33840a.webm?t=1721557813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/bb57fc1528f4c25980e7712aac33840a.mp4?t=1721557813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And more</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immerse yourself in a dark, mysterious world.<br></li><li>Look for the most unexpected solutions to continue your adventure.<br></li><li>Unravel the secrets of this world and yourself.<br></li><li>Break through every corner of this unholy place.<br></li><li>Challenge different unique enemies and situations.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/746aff876ff10dcb803fa98759857e08.poster.avif?t=1721557813\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/746aff876ff10dcb803fa98759857e08.webm?t=1721557813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/746aff876ff10dcb803fa98759857e08.mp4?t=1721557813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Fall headlong into a dark world where every rustle is a signal of another danger. Will you be able to find anything in it but emptiness and destruction? Find out if you can find yourself, or if you'll remain a cracked Porcelain Mask somewhere in an uncharted ditch.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/e265ee2b586694befbd31d424f1d5e55.poster.avif?t=1721557813\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/e265ee2b586694befbd31d424f1d5e55.webm?t=1721557813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/e265ee2b586694befbd31d424f1d5e55.mp4?t=1721557813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/f2ce4c7e969eee46fae4da839d81c0de.poster.avif?t=1721557813\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/f2ce4c7e969eee46fae4da839d81c0de.webm?t=1721557813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808440/extras/f2ce4c7e969eee46fae4da839d81c0de.mp4?t=1721557813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
